00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.900
That's hysterical!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.800
Ain't it?!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.930
Really, you've got to do something about these violent outbursts.

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.230
I can see your underwear.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.980
Minawa, are you feeling better?

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:34.540
Shouldn't you be lying down?

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.160
No, I'm fine. I'm sorry.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.310
Why did you take in that girl, knowing she's with Management?

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:50.360
At the very least, she's a time bomb. It could be a plot to snuff you out.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:55.420
If it were a plot, she would have strangled me in my sleep ages ago.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:17:00.630
Still, there may be some sort of hidden objective.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:06.220
There may very well be. Even I can't say for sure otherwise.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:10.010
If you yourself have doubts, then why?

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:15.430
It's something that Suguru told me that night.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:25.540
Mahoro?

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:30.010
Maybe we should take in that girl and look after her.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:36.320
The truth is, you want to help her, too, right?

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.340
Well, yes, but...

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.440
Hey, Mahoro?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.780
What role is Vesper playing in this conflict?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.350
They...

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.800
Well, they...

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:56.960
They act as a deterrent so the war with the aliens doesn't get out of control.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:02.970
And to lay a foundation for both sides to learn to understand one another one day...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:08.490
...and take each other by the hand and walk towards a single future.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:12.360
So that means they won't take sides?

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:16.040
Yes. At present, both are designated as the enemy.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:19.530
But that's... That's too sad!

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:23.010
But it's a mission that someone has to undertake...

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.260
...to keep the light of hope from being extinguished.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.000
I understand just how terrifying the organization called Management is...

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:36.960
...because of how reluctant you've been to tell me about them.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:41.430
As well as how dangerous it is to have something...

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.520
...from that organization in this house.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:49.150
But if we turned our backs on that girl who betrayed them,

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:54.230
we'd lose something we absolutely have to protect as human beings.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:19:00.240
We can't go around calling her 370, so... Let me think...

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:04.290
Why don't we call her Minawa Ando?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:05.650
Ando?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:09.130
Maybe having her pose as your little sister is overdoing it.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:17.080
Suguru... Thank you.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.260
I'm a warrior of Vesper.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:28.330
If all that's good in my heart were overwhelmed by suspicion,

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.710
I'd become the same as the Management.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:38.870
But I'm well aware of how sentimental all that sounds.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:42.680
Which is why I have a favor to ask of you both.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:52.090
If anything happens to me... Please protect Suguru together.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.660
I owe you one, so I give you my word.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.670
I will fulfill my vow as a warrior.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.350
Sheesh, what a showoff.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.560
As for me, no matter what happens,

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.210
...it's my duty to protect you and Suguru.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.980
So don't talk to me about what-ifs.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.990
Thank you, Slash.

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:20.120
Aw, cut it out. You're embarrassing me.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.630
Suguru, Minawa, it's dinnertime!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.510
Coming!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.510
Coming, coming, coming!

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:37.960
You went and invited yourself over again.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.540
Whew, I made it in time!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.470
Oh, that looks good!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.130
Please eat as much as you want.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.870
Sukiyaki, sukiyaki, you're so delicious...

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:53.890
Yum!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.930
What should I put in next?

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.600
What is it, Suguru?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.400
I-It's nothing.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.830
You'd better eat quick, or I'll eat all the meat!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.560
It's good.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.450
There! Got the meat!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:12.900
Hey! The vegetables are good, too, so you have to eat those, too!

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:17.400
Better grab some meat, too, Minawa, or you'll become like your big sister.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.300
Right.

